[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22800.05, "timestamp": "06:20:00", "text": "像乔乔一样愚蠢。哦，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22802.35, "timestamp": "06:20:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22806.628, "timestamp": "06:20:06", "text": "有趣的。这很有意思。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22812.23, "timestamp": "06:20:12", "text": "有趣的。是啊，我应该看看。或许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22815.59, "timestamp": "06:20:15", "text": "我们，你知道，嗯，如果我说我们，我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22817.75, "timestamp": "06:20:17", "text": "看看吧，我可能不会做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22820.39, "timestamp": "06:20:20", "text": "它。所以，如果有的话，如果每个人都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22823.59, "timestamp": "06:20:23", "text": "愿意为此付出代价，我们就可以这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22826.548, "timestamp": "06:20:26", "text": "一起看或者做点别的什么。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22829.91, "timestamp": "06:20:29", "text": "我想，这样更好。我不知道。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22832.27, "timestamp": "06:20:32", "text": "这样，我就可以真正坐下来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22843.19, "timestamp": "06:20:43", "text": "所以这也是我还没做到的一件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22844.24, "timestamp": "06:20:44", "text": "观看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22845.868, "timestamp": "06:20:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22855.948, "timestamp": "06:20:55", "text": "痛苦中夹杂着夸张的幽默。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22859.11, "timestamp": "06:20:59", "text": "哇。我不知道我是不是该笑，或者别的什么。"}]